{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that at the end of any year, a unit of money has lost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the value it had at the beginning of that year. Find the smallest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> years, the money will have lost at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/870303feff6f491471061a7402eba3e326ba84f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of its value (To the nearest thousandth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/677b54d15d53daaa1ac3febad372262de37283de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{3}=0.477$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"19\" />).\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7da5af10855d70a6de3f7869639642a4435c90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 14\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 18\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 20\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> years, the money will be worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/f/09ffcf7cb5d6d3b4c5a6d3a39ad3e7e39da40995.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.9)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"48\" height=\"20\" /> times what it is currently worth.  Therefore, the goal is to find the smallest integer such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b59002f3a663b224365c6cc70aacdea4151bbbda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.9)^n &lt; 0.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />.  Taking the base-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> logarithm of both sides yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d80d4e73a1f6607256438cec8cb0c21541cc69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\log_{10}{0.9} &lt; \\log_{10}{0.1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"168\" height=\"19\" />, which is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/1/141943eecb13c15f42574ae076fbea8dfe2aebf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; \\frac{\\log_{10}{0.1}}{\\log_{10}{0.9}} = \\frac{-1}{-1+2\\log_{10}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"240\" height=\"44\" />. \n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/59891fb6b9bd71b2a079822c7bf22d3a335834f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}{3} \\approx 0.477$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"19\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/9667087b1041170ead4090289391f60556a8a946.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; \\frac{-1}{-1 + 2 \\cdot 0.477} = \\frac{-1}{-0.046} \\approx 21.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"290\" height=\"40\" />, so the minimum possible integer value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/a/eda536530966b7983b6de9ed52f7d284c4276c56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{E})\\ 22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"64\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>-edited by Maxxie, maxamc, j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"c